From: Prospero Win contributors <prospero-win@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] ntdll: prepare observer-aware native BOP context publication

Publish a complete native transaction view to I386 CPU-area and Wow64 FP
observers. Suspension serialization edits that view; copy commit detects
interruptions and uses Wine's existing signal set only after repeated edits.
The original Unix native FP frame stays authoritative for native ABI state.
This is an inactive dependency: no BOP consumer or activation is added.

diff --git a/dlls/ntdll/unix/signal_x86_64.c b/dlls/ntdll/unix/signal_x86_64.c
--- a/dlls/ntdll/unix/signal_x86_64.c
+++ b/dlls/ntdll/unix/signal_x86_64.c
@@ -78,16 +78,19 @@

